# Rewritten by the nightly refresh: when the prices were last updated.
!PRICES.md

# The price catalogue is published straight to the site by the nightly
# refresh and is no longer kept in git. Committing it put a bot in the
# contributors list and grew the repository by ~20MB a night. Locally,
# `npm run prices:pull` fetches the live copy into public/.
public/price-catalog-*.json

# Bot runtime artefacts, regenerated on each run.
bot/node_modules
bot/cache
bot/output
bot/*.log

# Local test and screenshot scripts; not part of the site.
scratchpad/
